case ok-ignored-lines
desc the own whisper echo, another prefix and a stock chat line are ignored; an unknown TBM type is recorded
recv addon WHISPER TBM roster
recv addon PARTY OTHER TBM:VERSION|v9
recv system Bot commands: roster, version
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:FROBNICATE|1
expect ignored.count 3
expect unknown.count 1
expect hello.version (empty)
expect problems.count 0
